# S3 fixture ("created as Excel shows it"): headers and footers through s3-print's Page Setup (its
# pagesetup: script op): a different first page and different odd and even pages, each with its own
# header and footer, the sheet name (&A) and page numbers (&P, &N), custom margins (inches: top,
# bottom, left, right, header, footer), centered on the page, scaled to 90 %. Letter, portrait.
# 120 rows: three pages, so the first, an even and an odd page each print.
sheet-name "Headers"
enter A1 "Line"
enter B1 "Amount"
enter C1 "Running total"
enter A2 "Line 1"
fill-series A2:A120
enter B2 "=MOD(ROW()*37;100)"
fill-down B2:B120
enter C2 "=SUM($B$2:B2)"
fill-down C2:C120
format B1:C1 bold
pagesetup paper=1
pagesetup scale=90
pagesetup margins=1,0.8,0.6,0.6,0.4,0.3
pagesetup center=h
pagesetup header=&L&A&RPrinted copy
pagesetup footer=&CPage &P of &N
pagesetup firstheader=&CFirst page header
pagesetup firstfooter=&RFirst page &P
pagesetup evenheader=&L&A&REven page
pagesetup evenfooter=&LPage &P (even)
save
expect cell Headers!A120 text Line 119
expect cell Headers!C120 formula =SUM($B$2:B120)
expect pagesetup Headers orientation 1 zoom 90 wide 1 tall 1 titlerows  titlecols  area
expect pagemargins Headers left 43.2 right 43.2 top 72 bottom 57.6 header 28.8 footer 21.6 center True False
expect pageheaders Headers differentfirst True oddeven True scale True align True
expect pageheader Headers header left &A
expect pageheader Headers header right Printed copy
expect pageheader Headers footer center Page &P of &N
expect pageheader Headers first header center First page header
expect pageheader Headers first footer right First page &P
expect pageheader Headers even header left &A
expect pageheader Headers even header right Even page
expect pageheader Headers even footer left Page &P (even)
